{"source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart", "precision": "tts", "offset": 0, "duration": 87.962, "sentences": [{"text": "The whole production stack runs on one laptop, with one command.", "start": 0, "end": 3.636}, {"text": "Make up starts fifteen containers: the edge, the gateway, the site, the meter's database, the model server, and the tools that watch them, from metrics and logs to Grafana and Langfuse.", "start": 3.886, "end": 15.07}, {"text": "The model server is llama dot cpp on the laptop's GPU, running Qwen3, thirty billion parameters, in twenty-one of the card's twenty-four gigabytes.", "start": 15.32, "end": 25.622}, {"text": "Every question tries it first.", "start": 25.872, "end": 27.465}, {"text": "A local answer costs nothing, and nothing leaves the machine.", "start": 27.714, "end": 30.969}, {"text": "Only when it's down does the capped paid fallback answer.", "start": 31.22, "end": 34.007}, {"text": "On the cloud server, which has no GPU, the Anthropic API answers first.", "start": 34.257, "end": 39.203}, {"text": "This is production, not a demo: every image pinned by its digest, and one build at one commit, the same image everywhere.", "start": 39.453, "end": 47.079}, {"text": "Offline-first isn't new for Hareet.", "start": 47.329, "end": 49.249}, {"text": "At Medic, the community health workers using the Community Health Toolkit had older Android phones, and mostly no network.", "start": 49.499, "end": 56.56}, {"text": "So Hareet designed Voice for CHT: the health worker speaks the visit, and the form fills itself, offline.", "start": 56.81, "end": 63.457}, {"text": "Hareet helped the team fine-tune its models to two hundred seventy-three megabytes, to run beside the app on a four-gigabyte phone.", "start": 63.707, "end": 71.445}, {"text": "No audio or transcript leaves the phone as telemetry.", "start": 71.695, "end": 75.065}, {"text": "At denverlocal dot A I, the same idea serves small Denver teams: private AI, with sensitive files kept on hardware they own.", "start": 75.314, "end": 83.841}, {"text": "Local models first.", "start": 84.092, "end": 85.37}, {"text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.", "start": 85.619, "end": 87.961}], "words": [{"word": "The", "start": 0, "end": 0.173}, {"word": "whole", "start": 0.173, "end": 0.519}, {"word": "production", "start": 0.519, "end": 1.038}, {"word": "stack", "start": 1.038, "end": 1.211}, {"word": "runs", "start": 1.211, "end": 1.556}, {"word": "on", "start": 1.556, "end": 1.729}, {"word": "one", "start": 1.729, "end": 2.075}, {"word": "laptop", "start": 2.075, "end": 2.421}, {"word": "with", "start": 2.736, "end": 2.916}, {"word": "one", "start": 2.916, "end": 3.276}, {"word": "command", "start": 3.276, "end": 3.636}, {"word": "Make", "start": 3.886, "end": 4.264}, {"word": "up", "start": 4.264, "end": 4.453}, {"word": "starts", "start": 4.453, "end": 4.641}, {"word": "fifteen", "start": 4.641, "end": 5.019}, {"word": "containers", "start": 5.019, "end": 5.586}, {"word": "the", "start": 5.586, "end": 6.271}, {"word": "edge", "start": 6.271, "end": 6.657}, {"word": "the", "start": 6.657, "end": 7.038}, {"word": "gateway", "start": 7.038, "end": 7.612}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.612, "end": 7.805}, {"word": "site", "start": 7.805, "end": 8.381}, {"word": "the", "start": 8.381, "end": 8.571}, {"word": "meter's", "start": 8.571, "end": 9.138}, {"word": "database", "start": 9.138, "end": 9.895}, {"word": "the", "start": 9.895, "end": 10.085}, {"word": "model", "start": 10.085, "end": 10.719}, {"word": "server", "start": 10.719, "end": 11.101}, {"word": "and", "start": 11.101, "end": 11.291}, {"word": "the", "start": 11.291, "end": 11.48}, {"word": "tools", "start": 11.48, "end": 11.67}, {"word": "that", "start": 11.67, "end": 11.86}, {"word": "watch", "start": 11.86, "end": 12.432}, {"word": "them", "start": 12.432, "end": 12.622}, {"word": "from", "start": 12.622, "end": 12.811}, {"word": "metrics", "start": 12.811, "end": 13.187}, {"word": "and", "start": 13.187, "en